Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.79,0:00:24.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,I don't often see you on at this hour.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.90,0:00:28.45,Default,H,0,0,0,,Sakamoto...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.45,Default,S,0,0,0,,Want to play?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.40,0:00:34.07,Default,H,0,0,0,,Not right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.78,0:00:35.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.48,0:00:46.61,Default,H,0,0,0,,You aren't going to ask me what happened, are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.28,0:00:50.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,I have things I don't want to talk about as well,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.89,0:00:52.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,so I don't, and I won't ask you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.54,0:00:56.12,Default,S,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.28,0:01:08.43,Default,H,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.24,0:01:16.61,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sakamoto?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.24,0:01:21.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wasn't going to play the game.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.35,0:01:26.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,208)\i1}But I gave up on that so easily to save myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.73,0:01:31.90,Default,Mi,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you ask me, the people playing the game are the sane ones.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.48,0:01:37.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}His will was stronger than mine.
