Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.17,0:03:14.57,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Let's spend the night here.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.67,0:03:18.26,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,It's okay, Kinoshita.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.26,0:03:20.05,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.01,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Lizards again?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.77,0:03:32.44,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,But they won't make it up here—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.56,0:03:41.61,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I've got no choice...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.50,0:03:48.25,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,because you can't get off this island, without getting chips.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.36,0:03:53.97,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You said you'd protect me, didn't you,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.88,0:03:56.19,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Kakimoto?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.84,0:04:00.01,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Well then, die for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.24,0:04:14.43,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I'm going to survive this, no matter what I have to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.68,0:04:21.67,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,At first, everyone gathers peacefully and helps each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.50,0:04:25.09,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,But once their lives are in danger,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.09,0:04:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,they don't hesitate to betray each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.45,0:04:31.62,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Personally, I think that's the best part.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.62,0:04:33.41,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,What do you think, CEO?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.28,0:04:36.41,Default,CEO,0,0,0,,It's a terrible sight.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.41,0:04:39.96,Default,CEO,0,0,0,,And this is actually happening on the island right now?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.62,0:04:44.35,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Some people don't want to see real gore,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.35,0:04:48.19,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,so I think 3D models will be more suitable for streaming.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.19,0:04:52.51,Default,CEO,0,0,0,,Yes, we'll still use the original audio, so you can easily picture it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.51,0:04:54.23,Default,CEO,0,0,0,,It's really something to hear.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.23,0:04:58.48,Default,CEO,0,0,0,,If you watch it live, you can see what all the players are doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.28,0:05:02.23,Default,CEO,0,0,0,,It makes you feel like a god.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.23,0:05:03.97,Default,CEO,0,0,0,,You've done better than expected.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.97,0:05:05.74,Default,CEO,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.74,0:05:08.45,Default,CEO,0,0,0,,It won't be long before we announce the project.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.45,0:05:11.99,Default,CEO,0,0,0,,Make sure the final touch-ups are finished.
