Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.50,0:05:24.26,Default,S,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.70,0:05:26.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,since we've scouted this much, we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.97,0:05:29.13,Default,S,0,0,0,,No one's in this building except us.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.85,0:05:33.91,Default,S,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'd like to hurry back to Mr. Taira right now,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.91,0:05:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but the jungle is too dangerous at night.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.92,0:05:40.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,Let's go to sleep soon,\Nso we can leave at first light.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.48,0:05:44.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.73,0:05:46.01,Default,S,0,0,0,,let's eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.57,0:05:50.95,Default,S,0,0,0,,There was so much, but we're starting to run out.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.50,0:05:57.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.70,0:05:59.45,Default,S,0,0,0,,Eat this and cheer up.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.94,0:06:10.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's probably about time I changed clothes.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.93,0:06:12.95,Default,S,0,0,0,,A shirt with the {\i1}BTOOOM!{\i0} logo?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.95,0:06:14.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,Lame.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.30,0:06:16.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,Here, this is for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.46,0:06:18.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,A T-shirt.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.37,0:06:19.85,Default,S,0,0,0,,You can use it to sleep in.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.86,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm just going to go change.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.09,0:06:48.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko, can I come in?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.14,0:06:52.09,Default,H,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.84,0:06:54.59,Default,S,0,0,0,,You sleep in here.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.59,0:06:56.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll go to another room.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.96,0:06:57.93,Default,H,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.43,0:07:00.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you rather not \Nhave a guy like me here?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.20,0:07:07.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm not going to screw you over.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.20,0:07:09.61,Default,S,0,0,0,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.61,0:07:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,D—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.06,0:07:15.05,Default,H,0,0,0,,Don't leave me alone in a place like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.98,0:07:18.20,Default,H,0,0,0,,It's scary, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.42,0:07:21.95,Default,S,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.06,0:07:24.75,Default,S,0,0,0,,Then let's sleep together.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.94,0:07:28.73,Default,H,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant, you pervert!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.34,0:07:30.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's not what {\i1}I{\i0} meant, either!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.54,0:07:33.53,Default,H,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.14,0:07:37.35,Default,H,0,0,0,,Here's the line. Don't you dare cross it!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.06,0:07:39.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.31,0:07:41.68,Default,H,0,0,0,,And don't ogle me while I'm asleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.68,0:07:43.02,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.80,0:07:44.77,Default,S,0,0,0,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.24,0:07:58.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess she's starting to trust me, at least a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.06,0:08:03.25,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}If she hadn't saved me back there...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.02,0:08:07.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,Thanks for earlier, Himiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.12,0:08:11.47,Default,S,0,0,0,,Already asleep?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.10,0:08:15.09,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'm up.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.10,0:08:18.47,Default,H,0,0,0,,I should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.47,0:08:21.65,Default,H,0,0,0,,But coming after me without BIMs...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.22,0:08:23.59,Default,H,0,0,0,,That was crazy.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.16,0:08:25.48,Default,H,0,0,0,,You're nuts.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.32,0:08:28.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.48,0:08:30.71,Default,H,0,0,0,,Why would you do all that?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.71,0:08:35.05,Default,H,0,0,0,,You did it all for someone you only knew in-game, never having met them in person.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.56,0:08:37.59,Default,H,0,0,0,,You didn't need to go that far.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.86,0:08:43.09,Default,S,0,0,0,,Even thinking about it now,\N I'm not quite sure myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.67,0:08:45.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira was hurt,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.33,0:08:48.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,and I'd been knocked off the cliff...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.88,0:08:50.38,Default,S,0,0,0,,Maybe I just wasn't thinking straight.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.54,0:08:55.15,Default,S,0,0,0,,When I'm backed into a corner,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.38,0:08:58.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,my internal limiter turns off,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.69,0:09:02.59,Default,S,0,0,0,,and I feel another, calmer part of me come out.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.73,0:09:07.61,Default,S,0,0,0,,Maybe I've just played too many games.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.12,0:09:12.89,Default,H,0,0,0,,That still doesn't explain why you took such a huge risk to save me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.54,0:09:20.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,It was because I figured out that you really were\N the Himiko I knew from {\i1}BTOOOM!{\i0} at that moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.86,0:09:28.09,Default,S,0,0,0,,I was a NEET, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.75,0:09:31.29,Default,S,0,0,0,,I dropped out of school. I didn't work.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.29,0:09:33.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,I just played online games day after day.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.96,0:09:38.14,Default,S,0,0,0,,I put my online friends ahead of everything else in my life.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.89,0:09:44.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,To me, my Internet avatar was the real me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.26,0:09:48.85,Default,S,0,0,0,,And my friends on the net were everything to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.40,0:09:53.41,Default,S,0,0,0,,But Himiko... she cared about me anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.46,0:09:56.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,It made me really happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.78,0:09:59.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,Maybe I was just starved for human affection.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.04,0:10:02.78,Default,S,0,0,0,,So when I thought she was in danger,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.78,0:10:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think twice.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.18,0:10:07.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,Turned out I was wrong, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.80,0:10:09.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.69,0:10:11.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,I was mistaken.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.04,0:10:12.99,Default,S,0,0,0,,But I'm glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.47,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}What? She fell asleep?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.76,0:10:20.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.28,0:10:28.07,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dummy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.80,0:10:32.43,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was so happy, I could've burst.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.84,0:10:39.17,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just when I had given up, you came to save me, like the hero in a movie.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.16,0:10:44.33,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,378)\i1}And you were the Sakamoto I knew...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.68,0:10:47.21,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hadn't planned to meet you in real life.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.26,0:10:52.83,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't want to open my heart to any more men.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.83,0:10:55.55,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know what to do!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.28,0:11:15.69,Default,H,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.27,0:11:17.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.11,0:11:20.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.03,0:11:21.32,Default,H,0,0,0,,I—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.76,0:11:30.54,Default,H,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.66,0:11:39.07,Default,S,0,0,0,,What is it? What happened?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.68,0:11:41.55,Default,H,0,0,0,,S-Someone was here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.55,0:11:43.18,Default,H,0,0,0,,I saw a pale white person...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.34,0:11:45.43,Default,H,0,0,0,,maybe a ghost.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.43,0:11:46.77,Default,S,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.53,0:12:00.15,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Radar shows nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.90,0:12:03.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}We searched this building carefully.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.04,0:12:06.66,Default,S,0,0,0,,Are you sure you saw someone?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.02,0:12:14.59,Default,H,0,0,0,,He looked right at me \Nthrough disheveled black hair,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.59,0:12:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,with a really scary expression...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.83,Default,S,0,0,0,,It was probably a bad dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.54,0:12:24.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,You had a rough day, \N so it would make sense.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.18,0:12:26.79,Default,H,0,0,0,,I really saw him!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.79,0:12:29.31,Default,H,0,0,0,,He shone a light in my face!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.31,0:12:31.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,He had a flashlight?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.58,0:12:32.71,Default,H,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.71,0:12:35.36,Default,H,0,0,0,,I couldn't really see his features \Nsince it was so bright,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.80,0:12:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure he had a flashlight.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.61,0:12:42.20,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's gotta be another player.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.82,0:12:51.51,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter how many times I try,\N I'm getting nothing with my radar.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.51,0:12:55.38,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he were running away, \NI should see him moving!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.38,0:12:59.51,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then that means... could he be hiding close to us?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.04,0:13:01.38,Default,S,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.38,0:13:03.34,Default,S,0,0,0,,We'll look for him together.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.22,0:13:09.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,There really isn't anyone here.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.22,0:13:12.09,Default,S,0,0,0,,Let's split up and search.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.10,0:13:15.17,Default,S,0,0,0,,You check this floor.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.17,0:13:16.86,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll take the one above.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.64,0:13:19.07,Default,H,0,0,0,,It's too dark...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.07,0:13:20.21,Default,H,0,0,0,,I can't go alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.21,0:13:22.15,Default,H,0,0,0,,I can't! I can't! I can't!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.66,0:13:24.23,Default,S,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.23,0:13:26.74,Default,S,0,0,0,,We need to find him {\i1}now{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.24,0:13:28.19,Default,S,0,0,0,,A light...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.37,0:13:33.83,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll go look.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.60,0:13:37.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,Send two radar echoes if you need me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.58,0:13:39.59,Default,H,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.01,0:13:44.35,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's far away.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.86,0:13:46.69,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did he run that far?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.58,0:13:50.21,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}How could he without showing up on radar?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.21,0:13:52.75,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or is he hiding around here?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.85,0:13:55.81,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}There could also be a second person.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.08,0:14:04.23,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one's here.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.03,0:14:07.49,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what's with this room?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.52,0:14:12.67,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's like someone's been staying here a long time.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.16,0:14:15.28,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whoever's living here...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.28,0:14:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They left the light on. Where did they...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.28,0:14:21.43,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this like the{\i0} BTOOOM! {\i1}trick,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.43,0:14:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}where you leave a trail to lure the enemy in?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.92,0:14:25.51,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}A booby trap?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.28,0:14:27.11,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.11,0:14:29.26,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to get out of here!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.78,0:14:43.90,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.86,0:14:52.87,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}A woman?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.66,0:14:55.33,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her left arm...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.33,0:14:57.67,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah, she doesn't have a chip.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.67,0:14:59.97,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why she didn't show up on radar.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.68,0:15:02.67,Default,H,0,0,0,,This{\i1} was the "ghost."
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.26,0:15:04.81,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she a player, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.81,0:15:05.93,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if she is,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.70,0:15:08.99,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}how long has she been here?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.19,0:15:19.73,Default,H,0,0,0,,Hey, Himiko, actually...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.48,0:15:27.87,Default,H,0,0,0,,You really scared me!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.38,0:15:29.65,Default,H,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.72,0:15:32.28,Default,H,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.32,0:15:34.93,Default,H,0,0,0,,Come with you?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.78,0:15:38.29,Default,H,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.29,0:15:39.75,Default,S,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.75,0:15:43.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,But her chip is gone, along with her left hand.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.05,0:15:45.55,Default,S,0,0,0,,She seems to have been here a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.26,0:15:49.63,Default,S,0,0,0,,If nothing else, she isn't one of the players who arrived with us.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.36,0:15:56.13,Default,H,0,0,0,,U-Um, are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.28,0:15:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A man!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.19,0:16:00.25,Default,?,0,0,0,,S-Stay back!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.25,0:16:01.41,Default,?,0,0,0,,G-G-Get out!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.41,0:16:02.63,Default,H,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.41,0:16:02.63,Overlap,H,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.63,0:16:04.65,Default,H,0,0,0,,We aren't going to hurt you!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.65,0:16:05.41,Default,?,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.41,0:16:06.31,Default,?,0,0,0,,A man!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.31,0:16:08.13,Default,?,0,0,0,,Get out, you pig!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.34,0:16:08.55,Overlap,H,0,0,0,,Leave the room.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.80,0:16:09.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.80,0:16:09.82,Overlap,S,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.82,0:16:12.45,Default,H,0,0,0,,Just let me handle this!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.82,0:16:12.45,Overlap,?,0,0,0,,Get out! Go away!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.45,0:16:13.79,Overlap,H,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.48,0:16:15.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,What's her problem?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.79,0:16:15.39,Overlap,H,0,0,0,,We won't do anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.39,0:16:16.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that hurt!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.30,0:16:21.29,Default,?,0,0,0,,What do you want with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.29,0:16:23.57,Default,?,0,0,0,,I don't have a chip or any BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.57,0:16:24.53,Default,H,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.53,0:16:28.22,Default,H,0,0,0,,I was hoping you could tell me \Na little about this island.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.18,0:16:33.09,Default,?,0,0,0,,Then let me tell you something important.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.09,0:16:34.47,Default,?,0,0,0,,If you're a woman,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.47,0:16:36.47,Default,?,0,0,0,,you shouldn't trust any men here.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.98,0:16:42.97,Default,H,0,0,0,,That's what I thought, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.98,0:16:49.79,Default,H,0,0,0,,But now, I think I'll need to \Nwork with him to survive.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.56,0:16:53.37,Default,?,0,0,0,,You trust him that much?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.37,0:16:56.23,Default,H,0,0,0,,Yes, I do now.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.87,0:17:00.27,Default,H,0,0,0,,He's saved me many times.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.91,0:17:03.38,Default,H,0,0,0,,And I knew him from before all this.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.63,Default,?,0,0,0,,You're being naïve.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.63,0:17:08.47,Default,?,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean anything around here.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.47,0:17:10.63,Default,?,0,0,0,,Everyone on this island loves only themselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.32,0:17:17.89,Default,?,0,0,0,,Did you two just get here?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.64,0:17:21.13,Default,?,0,0,0,,Then maybe I can't make you understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.68,0:17:23.73,Default,?,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.24,0:17:26.83,Default,?,0,0,0,,You seem like a danger magnet;\N I can't just ignore you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.83,0:17:28.78,Default,?,0,0,0,,I'll tell you a thing or two.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.00,0:17:35.23,Default,?,0,0,0,,It's probably been half a year since I came here.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.86,0:17:39.11,Default,?,0,0,0,,My name is Murasaki Shiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.11,0:17:40.87,Default,?,0,0,0,,I was a nurse.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.87,0:17:44.12,Default,?,0,0,0,,I worked hard at a hospital \Nthat was understaffed.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.12,0:17:46.88,Default,?,0,0,0,,And before I knew it, I was nearly forty.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.36,0:17:50.96,Default,?,0,0,0,,One day, there was a serious medical accident.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.96,0:17:54.89,Default,?,0,0,0,,The doctor in charge of the operation was a man I respected.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.72,0:18:00.39,Default,?,0,0,0,,Because I respected him, I did \Neverything in my power to protect him.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.39,0:18:03.14,Default,?,0,0,0,,I even tampered with the medical records.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.60,0:18:04.53,Default,?,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.28,0:18:10.03,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nurse Murasaki is completely responsible.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.03,0:18:13.78,Default,?,0,0,0,,The hospital abandoned me
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.18,0:18:16.55,Default,?,0,0,0,,to face an angry public alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.32,0:18:20.47,Default,?,0,0,0,,And then I got a letter.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.98,0:18:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It said, "Is there anyone around whom you'd like to be rid of?"
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.60,0:18:32.80,Default,?,0,0,0,,But in the end, I was chosen by \Nsomeone who had a grudge against me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.64,0:18:40.81,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's put the past behind us and overcome this together.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.81,0:18:44.56,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll get fourteen chips and both escape!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.06,0:18:53.27,Default,?,0,0,0,,We began to play this murderer's game.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.28,0:18:55.57,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the fifth chip.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.40,0:18:58.74,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all thanks to you, Shiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.74,0:19:00.63,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll never let you go again.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.58,0:19:04.08,Default,?,0,0,0,,The two of us were together on this island.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.26,0:19:08.75,Default,?,0,0,0,,But the moment we killed the sixth player...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.76,0:19:15.42,Default,?,0,0,0,,{\i1}D-Dr. Date?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.46,0:19:20.93,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I kill you, I'll have seven chips.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.46,0:19:23.21,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's all I need.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.24,0:19:25.03,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.96,0:19:43.95,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess the homing bombs aren't very powerful.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.95,0:19:46.04,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}It didn't kill her.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.04,0:19:49.57,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}But, luckily enough, it looks like it blew off her chip.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.56,0:19:53.77,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}See ya, Shiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.40,0:19:56.34,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll live for you, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.90,0:20:01.81,Default,?,0,0,0,,I was such a stupid woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.08,0:20:09.41,Default,?,0,0,0,,But without a chip, I didn't \Nregister on anyone's radar.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.41,0:20:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So I survived here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.86,0:20:15.73,Default,H,0,0,0,,You're from the previous game, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.36,0:20:20.97,Default,?,0,0,0,,What are they thinking, repeating this game again and again?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.24,0:20:26.20,Default,?,0,0,0,,You should be careful, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.71,Default,?,0,0,0,,When you get six chips,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.40,0:20:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,the two of you will be tested.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.18,0:20:36.28,Default,S,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.28,0:20:37.59,Default,S,0,0,0,,She's a survivor from the last game.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.06,0:20:41.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,But from her story, \Nif you get all the chips,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.27,0:20:43.15,Default,S,0,0,0,,someone will come for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.15,0:20:46.22,Default,?,0,0,0,,She said a helicopter landed.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.22,0:20:49.83,Default,S,0,0,0,,Do you think it would be possible to jack it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.73,0:20:53.92,Default,?,0,0,0,,We have all these BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.92,0:20:56.73,Default,?,0,0,0,,Don't you think we could \Nthreaten a helicopter pilot?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.73,0:21:02.17,Default,?,0,0,0,,We could get enough for one person, seven chips, and call the helicopter.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.17,0:21:06.24,Default,?,0,0,0,,If it works, me and you,\N that woman, and Mr. Taira...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.24,0:21:09.73,Default,?,0,0,0,,If we work together, we could all get out of here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.25,0:21:13.91,Default,?,0,0,0,,It's dawn.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.91,0:21:15.86,Default,?,0,0,0,,Let's get back to Mr. Taira.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.86,0:21:17.05,Default,H,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.78,0:21:24.25,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}I couldn't tell him about what \Nhappens when you get six chips.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.20,0:21:28.18,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}I trust him.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.62,0:21:29.39,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.56,0:21:31.77,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}I couldn't tell him that...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.36,0:21:36.19,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}or who I really am.
