Dialogue: 10,0:23:09.03,0:23:11.09,Default,?,0,0,0,,If you're going to the observation point,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:11.09,0:23:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the path along the mountain is your best bet.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.25,0:23:15.09,Default,H,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:15.09,0:23:18.04,Default,H,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything you've told us.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:18.04,0:23:19.17,Default,?,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:19.17,0:23:21.65,Default,?,0,0,0,,I've taken a liking to you,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:21.65,0:23:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,so I just want to help you.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.36,0:23:28.30,Default,?,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:28.30,0:23:31.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,I thought I could use this against any lizards.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.04,0:23:33.77,Default,?,0,0,0,,Sticks are effective.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:33.77,0:23:37.65,Default,?,0,0,0,,But the giant lizards on this island are nocturnal,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:37.65,0:23:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so use it as a walking stick during the day.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.13,0:23:41.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll do that.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.24,0:23:46.70,Default,?,0,0,0,,Keep her safe, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:47.46,0:23:48.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.28,0:24:01.00,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.23,0:24:06.01,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe I was sent back to this island.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.78,0:24:09.71,Default,H,0,0,0,,This island is full of enemies.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.71,0:24:11.15,Default,H,0,0,0,,To save themselves
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.15,0:24:15.59,Default,H,0,0,0,,they'll act kind, then betray you without a second thought.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:15.59,0:24:18.60,Default,H,0,0,0,,The only person I can believe in is Ryouta.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.60,0:24:19.35,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ryouta...
